{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791296666328,"sessionID":"ses_eee6652b4ffe9HQInpetWd5nuk","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01a11199fadd73519f0391b7","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"[\n  {\"id\": \"q1\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n  {\"id\": \"q2\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n  {\"id\": \"q3\", \"model\": \"Unrouted\", \"effort\": null},\n  {\"id\": \"q4\", \"model\": \"atlas-lite\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n  {\"id\": \"q5\", \"model\": \"corvid-mini\", \"effort\": \"medium\"},\n  {\"id\": \"q6\", \"model\": \"pellet-2\", \"effort\": \"high\"}\n]","filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glmflash-max__routing__r1__1791296645/work/answers.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glmflash-max__routing__r1__1791296645/work/answers.json","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glmflash-max__routing__r1__1791296645/work/answers.json","time":{"start":1791296666313,"end":1791296666318}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me apply the policy to each request.\n\nModel table:\n- atlas-pro: Northwind family, cli nw, lanes implement/review/research, floor high, ceiling max\n- atlas-lite: Northwind, cli nw, lanes extract/prose, floor low, ceiling high\n- corvid-9: Corvid, cli cv, lanes implement/review, floor medium, ceiling max\n- corvid-mini: Corvid, cli cv, lanes extract, floor low, ceiling medium\n- pellet-2: Pellet, cli pl, lanes prose/research, floor medium, ceiling high\n\nLane order (first eligible wins):\n- implement: atlas-pro, corvid-9\n- review: corvid-9, atlas-pro\n- research: atlas-pro, pellet-2\n- extract: corvid-mini, atlas-lite\n- prose: pellet-2, atlas-lite\n\nRules:\nR1: lane must be in model's lanes.\nR2: review lane — model's family must differ from author_family.\nR3: pinned cli — only models on that cli.\nR4: skip unavailable models.\nR5: no eligible → \"Unrouted\", effort null.\nR6: effort clamping: below floor → floor; above ceiling → ceiling; else keep. Effort never makes model ineligible.\n\nEffort scale: low < medium < high < max.\n\nq1: lane implement, effort medium.\nCandidates in order: atlas-pro first. Implement is in atlas-pro lanes. No pinned cli, no unavailable, not review so R2 doesn't apply. atlas-pro eligible. Effort: floor high, ceiling max. Requested medium is below floor high → use floor high. Answer: model atlas-pro, effort high.\n\nq2: lane review, effort high, author_family Corvid.\nCandidates: corvid-9 first. R2: corvid-9 family is Corvid, author_family Corvid — same, not eligible. Next: atlas-pro, family Northwind ≠ Corvid, eligible. Effort: floor high, ceiling max; requested high is within → keep high. Answer: atlas-pro, high.\n\nq3: lane extract, effort low, pinned_cli pl.\nCandidates: corvid-mini (cli cv) — R3 fails. atlas-lite (cli nw) — R3 fails. No eligible → Unrouted, effort null. Answer: model Unrouted, effort null.\n\nq4: lane prose, effort max, unavailable [pellet-2].\nCandidates: pellet-2 — R4 skip. atlas-lite — prose in lanes, cli irrelevant, eligible. Effort: floor low, ceiling high; max is above ceiling high → use high. Answer: atlas-lite, high.\n\nq5: lane extract, effort max.\nCandidates: corvid-mini — extract in lanes, eligible. Effort: floor low, ceiling medium; max above ceiling → medium. Answer: corvid-mini, medium.\n\nq6: lane research, effort high, pinned_cli pl.\nCandidates: atlas-pro (cli nw) — R3 fails. pellet-2 (cli pl) — research in lanes, eligible. Effort: floor medium, ceiling high; requested high within → high. Answer: pellet-2, high.\n\nNow write answers.json in format: [{\"id\": \"...\", \"model\": \"...\", \"effort\": \"...\" or null}, ...]","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_11199fac5001BLJ3F7G9lYvPh5","sessionID":"ses_eee6652b4ffe9HQInpetWd5nuk","messageID":"msg_11199cccc001b0RuzyyqltWvt3"}}
